WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:01.600
Right now, someone near you is looking

00:01.650 --> 00:03.530
for exactly what you offer. A haircut,

00:03.750 --> 00:05.540
a coffee, a plumber. They pull out

00:05.590 --> 00:06.990
their phone, they type a few words,

00:07.110 --> 00:09.000
and within seconds they decide where to

00:09.050 --> 00:10.740
go. The question is simple. Do they

00:10.790 --> 00:12.200
find you or do they find your

00:12.250 --> 00:12.530
competitor?

00:14.189 --> 00:15.959
Many great small businesses live on word

00:16.009 --> 00:18.469
of mouth. Loyal regulars, a good reputation,

00:18.769 --> 00:20.579
maybe a Facebook page that hasn't been

00:20.629 --> 00:22.919
updated in a while. That works until

00:22.969 --> 00:25.319
a new customer searches online. Because a

00:25.369 --> 00:27.159
business without a proper website is easy

00:27.209 --> 00:29.869
to overlook. No opening hours, no prices,

00:30.009 --> 00:32.059
no photos, just a name on a

00:32.109 --> 00:32.249
map.

00:33.757 --> 00:35.587
Here's a simple combination that works. Your

00:35.637 --> 00:37.327
free Google Business profile is what people

00:37.377 --> 00:39.727
see first. Your name, your reviews, your

00:39.777 --> 00:41.437
opening hours, right there on the map.

00:41.597 --> 00:43.147
But the profile is only the first

00:43.197 --> 00:45.197
impression. One tap on the website button,

00:45.317 --> 00:47.327
and your website takes over. That's where

00:47.377 --> 00:49.287
people see your menu, your prices, your

00:49.337 --> 00:50.727
work, and where they decide to call

00:50.777 --> 00:52.607
you. The profile gets the click. The

00:52.657 --> 00:53.657
website wins the customer.

00:55.367 --> 00:56.757
So what does a good website actually

00:56.807 --> 00:58.847
do for a small business? Five things.

00:59.047 --> 01:00.617
First, it gets you found when people

01:00.667 --> 01:03.037
search. Second, it builds trust before anyone

01:03.087 --> 01:05.057
walks through your door. Third, it answers

01:05.107 --> 01:07.137
the basic questions. What you offer, what

01:07.187 --> 01:08.977
it costs, when you're open, and where

01:09.027 --> 01:10.617
you are. Fourth, it makes the next

01:10.667 --> 01:12.557
step easy. A call, a booking, a

01:12.607 --> 01:14.777
message. And fifth, it works perfectly on

01:14.827 --> 01:16.457
a phone, because that's where most people

01:16.507 --> 01:17.007
will see it.

01:18.379 --> 01:19.849
And here's the thing. Having just any

01:19.899 --> 01:22.369
website isn't enough. Many small business sites

01:22.419 --> 01:24.889
quietly send customers away. The page takes

01:24.939 --> 01:26.869
forever to load. It looks broken on

01:26.919 --> 01:28.449
a phone. The opening hours are from

01:28.499 --> 01:30.419
three years ago. There are no prices,

01:30.479 --> 01:32.589
so people assume it's expensive. And the

01:32.639 --> 01:34.009
phone number is hidden somewhere at the

01:34.059 --> 01:35.709
bottom. Every one of these is a

01:35.759 --> 01:37.469
small reason to keep scrolling and to

01:37.519 --> 01:38.379
choose someone else.

01:39.916 --> 01:41.566
Let's see what that looks like. Here's

01:41.616 --> 01:43.826
a small cafe, a clear headline, real

01:43.876 --> 01:46.176
opening hours, a short menu with prices,

01:46.336 --> 01:48.206
a map, and one big button to

01:48.256 --> 01:50.316
call or reserve a table. Nothing complicated.

01:50.516 --> 01:52.626
Just everything a customer needs in the

01:52.676 --> 01:54.566
right order on one clean page. And

01:54.616 --> 01:55.786
on a phone, it looks just as

01:55.836 --> 01:55.996
good.

01:57.488 --> 01:59.568
And every business needs something slightly different.

01:59.788 --> 02:01.738
A hair salon needs prices and a

02:01.788 --> 02:03.458
simple way to book. A plumber or

02:03.508 --> 02:05.318
an electrician needs the service area and

02:05.368 --> 02:06.558
a phone number you can tap in

02:06.608 --> 02:08.718
an emergency. A local club or association

02:08.768 --> 02:11.098
needs events, membership info, and a way

02:11.148 --> 02:12.758
to join. A good website is built

02:12.808 --> 02:14.318
around the one thing your customers wanna

02:14.368 --> 02:14.788
do next.

02:16.385 --> 02:17.695
This is exactly what I build at

02:17.745 --> 02:20.825
Taking Extra. Websites for salons, cafes, trades,

02:20.905 --> 02:22.735
and local associations. And the way it

02:22.785 --> 02:24.535
works is different. You don't pay first

02:24.585 --> 02:26.205
and hope for the best. Step one,

02:26.325 --> 02:27.635
you get in touch with just a

02:27.685 --> 02:29.665
few lines about your business. Step two,

02:29.765 --> 02:31.335
I build a free demo, your actual

02:31.385 --> 02:33.425
website as a first draft. Step three,

02:33.525 --> 02:34.995
we refine it together until it feels

02:35.045 --> 02:36.715
right. And step four, your site goes

02:36.765 --> 02:37.085
live.

02:38.631 --> 02:40.071
The free demo is the important part.

02:40.251 --> 02:41.981
You see your new website before you

02:42.031 --> 02:43.861
decide anything. If you like it, we

02:43.911 --> 02:46.361
continue. If not, you've lost nothing. To

02:46.411 --> 02:48.021
get started, I only need your business

02:48.071 --> 02:49.841
name, what you offer, and how people

02:49.891 --> 02:51.501
can reach you. A logo and a

02:51.551 --> 02:53.131
few photos help, but they're not required.

02:53.511 --> 02:55.281
Anything missing is simply marked in the

02:55.331 --> 02:55.511
draft.

02:57.113 --> 02:58.843
and the price. A website starts at

02:58.893 --> 03:01.823
250 euros. The exact price depends on

03:01.873 --> 03:03.183
what you need, and after a short

03:03.233 --> 03:05.263
conversation you get an individual quote in

03:05.313 --> 03:07.683
euros, swiss francs or forens. Your site

03:07.733 --> 03:09.443
can be in German, English or Hungarian

03:09.493 --> 03:11.173
or all three, and if you want,

03:11.273 --> 03:12.363
I can also take care of your

03:12.413 --> 03:13.233
Facebook and Instagram.

03:14.918 --> 03:16.268
And your website doesn't have to stand

03:16.318 --> 03:18.348
alone. If you'd like, I'll also look

03:18.398 --> 03:20.898
after your Facebook and Instagram. Regular posts,

03:21.098 --> 03:22.928
a consistent look, and every post leading

03:22.978 --> 03:24.848
back to your website. So people don't

03:24.898 --> 03:26.388
just see you once, they keep seeing

03:26.438 --> 03:27.458
you, week after week.

03:29.025 --> 03:30.675
Speaking of languages, if you're in a

03:30.725 --> 03:33.115
city with tourists, students, or expats, a

03:33.165 --> 03:34.755
second language on your website can make

03:34.805 --> 03:36.775
a real difference. Someone who doesn't speak

03:36.825 --> 03:38.495
the local language well will much rather

03:38.545 --> 03:40.815
choose the place they understand. I speak

03:40.865 --> 03:43.515
German, English, and Hungarian myself, so your

03:43.565 --> 03:45.135
texts are written by a person, not

03:45.185 --> 03:46.125
just run through a translator.

03:47.935 --> 03:49.895
I'm Martin, a web developer from Hungary.

03:50.055 --> 03:51.785
I use modern AI tools for the

03:51.835 --> 03:54.165
repetitive work, like first drafts and organizing

03:54.215 --> 03:56.565
emails. That saves time, and that time

03:56.615 --> 03:58.885
goes to you. Design, decisions, and your

03:58.935 --> 04:00.315
point of contact stay personal.

04:01.998 --> 04:03.688
A few questions I hear often. Is

04:03.738 --> 04:06.428
the demo really free? Yes. You decide

04:06.478 --> 04:08.528
afterwards, in your own time. Do I

04:08.578 --> 04:10.648
need to prepare a lot? No. A

04:10.698 --> 04:12.108
few lines about your business are enough

04:12.158 --> 04:13.798
to start. Can I change things later?

04:14.098 --> 04:16.368
Of course. We refine the site together

04:16.418 --> 04:18.348
before it goes live, and small updates

04:18.398 --> 04:19.338
are always possible.

04:20.875 --> 04:22.545
So, if your business deserves to be

04:22.595 --> 04:24.275
found, let's start with a free demo.

04:24.495 --> 04:26.685
Visit techingextra .com or write to me

04:26.735 --> 04:28.805
directly. A few lines are enough. See

04:28.855 --> 04:30.255
your new website before you decide.
